          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Try to evaluate the following using a suitable identity: (i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "3 5 ^ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "6 5 ^ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "8 5 ^ { 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " (iv) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 0 5 ^ { 2 }"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.178,
            0.199,
            0.573,
            0.218
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Do you observe any interesting pattern?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.158,
            0.221,
            0.854,
            0.26
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Observe the two rows of figures below. They represent an algebraic identity. Try to identify it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.125,
